WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.300 --> 01:39.020
[Episode 23]

01:39.230 --> 01:39.850
Go.

01:40.400 --> 01:40.980
I heard

01:41.400 --> 01:42.460
they're even stronger than those

01:42.510 --> 01:43.210
of the Five Poisons Sect.

01:43.710 --> 01:45.770
I've seen Wen Hujiu's Five Poisons.

01:46.400 --> 01:47.330
His centipedes

01:47.710 --> 01:48.730
had two heads.

01:59.230 --> 02:00.050
What array is this?

02:01.000 --> 02:01.660
The Five-Poison Array.

02:02.430 --> 02:03.300
Ordinarily,

02:03.350 --> 02:04.380
it's used to trap people,

02:04.950 --> 02:06.570
penning them inside,

02:06.570 --> 02:08.360
then unleashing the venoms.

02:09.120 --> 02:10.220
It's our Wen clan's secret art,

02:10.360 --> 02:11.450
not taught outside.

02:11.960 --> 02:13.540
You're flipping it now

02:14.280 --> 02:15.690
to isolate this floral poison?

02:16.280 --> 02:16.820
That's right.

02:17.470 --> 02:18.980
A toxin spread across the whole city...

02:20.680 --> 02:21.340
I've never heard of it.

02:22.010 --> 02:23.850
To pull off poisoning technique like this,

02:24.240 --> 02:25.940
only three people alive could.

02:26.800 --> 02:28.100
First that comes to mind

02:28.680 --> 02:29.890
is the Wen clan head,

02:30.430 --> 02:31.220
Wen Hujiu.

02:31.590 --> 02:32.660
My uncle's poisons

02:32.800 --> 02:33.780
truly top the world.

02:34.280 --> 02:35.670
Three generations up,

02:35.670 --> 02:37.020
three down,

02:37.080 --> 02:37.940
you won't find his equal,

02:37.940 --> 02:40.170
a genius of poisoning technique.

02:40.870 --> 02:41.910
But he's allied

02:41.920 --> 02:43.770
with Xueyue City,

02:44.080 --> 02:45.060
and would never meddle

02:45.120 --> 02:46.380
in Wushuang City's mess.

02:47.560 --> 02:48.100
Besides,

02:48.470 --> 02:49.130
this poison

02:49.520 --> 02:51.260
was clearly laid years in advance.

02:51.680 --> 02:53.010
My uncle's far too lazy for that.

02:53.400 --> 02:54.100
The second

02:55.190 --> 02:56.220
is likely from the Tang clan.

02:56.750 --> 02:57.340
Right.

02:57.910 --> 02:59.610
Their top poisoner,

03:00.000 --> 03:00.820
Tang Linghuang.

03:02.000 --> 03:02.730
But the Tang clan

03:03.150 --> 03:04.570
is also allied with Xueyue City.

03:05.150 --> 03:05.690
And besides,

03:05.870 --> 03:07.100
Tang Linghuang

03:07.280 --> 03:08.170
only favors

03:08.360 --> 03:09.660
poisons that kill.

03:10.120 --> 03:11.100
He even said,

03:11.750 --> 03:12.500
"If a poison

03:12.910 --> 03:14.450
can't kill the target,

03:14.840 --> 03:16.380
it doesn't deserve the name".

03:17.310 --> 03:18.820
On that point, his fixation

03:19.310 --> 03:20.380
is practically

03:20.630 --> 03:21.130
an obsession.

03:21.800 --> 03:22.780
Then the third?

03:23.590 --> 03:24.730
The Five Poisons Sect master,

03:25.280 --> 03:26.100
the Poison Enchantress,

03:26.400 --> 03:27.410
Luo Yandie.

03:28.240 --> 03:28.940
Only she likes

03:29.150 --> 03:30.690
floral-scented toxins.

03:31.870 --> 03:32.690
She prefers people

03:33.520 --> 03:35.890
to drift off in warmth and perfume,

03:36.190 --> 03:37.450
dying without knowing it.

03:39.520 --> 03:40.660
Poisoners like that

03:41.080 --> 03:42.450
have twisted tastes.

03:42.730 --> 03:43.970
Twisted or not,

03:44.470 --> 03:45.450
don't you already know?

03:46.840 --> 03:48.100
This Blossom Ash

03:48.740 --> 03:50.650
only suppresses inner power for a while.

03:50.710 --> 03:51.850
It doesn't kill.

03:52.560 --> 03:53.220
Which means

03:54.000 --> 03:54.890
they're holding a backup move.

03:55.590 --> 03:56.980
Right now in Sihuai City,

03:58.280 --> 03:59.610
quite a few top fighters have slipped in,

04:00.710 --> 04:01.380
including...

04:03.520 --> 04:04.290
Sword Deities.

04:07.590 --> 04:08.410
So, Lu Yuzhai

04:09.400 --> 04:10.570
refuses to work with us?

04:11.190 --> 04:11.850
He says

04:12.710 --> 04:13.380
his red line

04:13.560 --> 04:14.690
is not harming his master.

04:15.470 --> 04:17.660
[Night Crow, the Ghost Physician]
So after he gets those two letters,

04:19.600 --> 04:20.810
he'll report to his master.

04:22.120 --> 04:22.850
I failed.

04:23.430 --> 04:24.780
I couldn't intercept those two letters in time.

04:25.390 --> 04:27.020
Sihuai's survival is at stake.

04:27.870 --> 04:28.490
Lu Yuzhai

04:29.240 --> 04:30.580
will surely tell Song Yanhui.

04:31.270 --> 04:32.900
Liu Yunqi is dead.

04:33.720 --> 04:35.250
Jian Shanyue has retired.

04:35.750 --> 04:36.930
And Wushuang City now

04:37.560 --> 04:39.340
has only Song Yanhui left.

04:40.040 --> 04:40.810
Looks like

04:41.430 --> 04:42.850
the City Lord's seat

04:43.680 --> 04:45.410
needs a new occupant.

04:46.680 --> 04:47.730
Your Highness means

04:48.870 --> 04:50.460
the new City Lord of Wushuang City

04:50.830 --> 04:51.780
should be...

04:55.070 --> 04:56.780
Naturally, the Lunwu Hall chief,

04:57.950 --> 04:59.410
Jian Wudi.

05:03.630 --> 05:04.540
I've told you

05:05.070 --> 05:06.170
I have no interest

05:06.170 --> 05:07.040
[Jian Wudi of Wushuang City]

05:07.040 --> 05:08.140
in the City Lord's seat.

05:10.510 --> 05:11.170
Of course.

05:12.070 --> 05:13.810
You can devote yourself to the sword.

05:14.830 --> 05:16.580
The Peerless Sword Coffer I promised

05:17.360 --> 05:19.140
will be delivered to you.

05:22.240 --> 05:23.250
Much obliged, Your Highness.

05:27.950 --> 05:28.660
You're a man

05:29.240 --> 05:30.580
obsessed with the sword.

05:32.000 --> 05:33.700
All who are obsessed,

05:34.480 --> 05:35.170
if they never awaken,

05:35.950 --> 05:37.250
their lives are ruined.

05:37.600 --> 05:38.220
If they do awaken,

05:38.920 --> 05:40.220
they soar through the clouds.

05:41.040 --> 05:42.370
For you to come out of seclusion now,

05:43.310 --> 05:44.980
you must have realized something.

05:48.800 --> 05:51.170
I need a fine swordsman to test it.

05:51.360 --> 05:52.850
It's long been prepared for you.

05:54.360 --> 05:56.050
I'll track down Zhuo Yue'an

05:56.830 --> 05:57.540
and have him

05:58.830 --> 06:00.250
test your blade.

06:12.510 --> 06:13.220
May you

06:14.190 --> 06:14.810
ascend to the top

06:15.720 --> 06:16.490
with one strike.

06:53.510 --> 06:54.810
Go with him.

06:55.430 --> 06:56.020
Perhaps

06:56.830 --> 06:58.930
he will have use for you.

07:01.190 --> 07:01.730
As you command.

07:27.040 --> 07:27.900
What's wrong, Sir?

07:31.180 --> 07:34.300
[Luoyang Tavern]

07:35.160 --> 07:36.980
This guy lives for the sword.

07:37.600 --> 07:38.970
Yet when it's time to cross blades,

07:38.970 --> 07:39.690
he hesitates.

07:40.250 --> 07:41.120
[Luoyang Tavern]
Maybe...

07:41.430 --> 07:42.540
he's scared of Zhuo Yue'an?

07:44.120 --> 07:46.020
Luoyang Tavern...

07:48.630 --> 07:49.170
Sir,

07:49.560 --> 07:51.250
do you want a drink here?

07:53.160 --> 07:55.140
To the west lies Muliang City,

07:55.950 --> 07:59.050
home to the Lone Sword Deity.

07:59.950 --> 08:01.850
He's said to be the strongest

08:01.860 --> 08:03.310
of the Five Sword Deities.

08:04.270 --> 08:05.610
His name

08:06.070 --> 08:07.050
is Luo Qingyang.

08:10.830 --> 08:11.900
Luo Qingyang

08:12.190 --> 08:13.780
sealed his city long ago.

08:14.390 --> 08:15.140
All these years,

08:15.800 --> 08:17.900
he's never crossed swords with another Sword Deity.

08:18.680 --> 08:20.170
How can you call him number one?

08:20.950 --> 08:22.020
There's someone inside!

08:38.790 --> 08:40.010
What a fearsome sword energy!

08:40.750 --> 08:41.650
Not just fearsome,

08:42.480 --> 08:45.250
what's most distinctive in it

08:46.200 --> 08:47.420
is the killing intent.

08:48.670 --> 08:49.820
It's so heavy,

08:50.360 --> 08:51.530
and so dense.

08:52.840 --> 08:54.010
Within that killing intent

08:54.960 --> 08:56.580
surges a wrathful sword intent.

08:57.870 --> 08:59.730
It's the strongest sword energy

09:00.080 --> 09:01.100
I've ever seen.

09:03.510 --> 09:04.940
You've seen that many?

09:06.080 --> 09:07.340
A fair few.

09:08.750 --> 09:10.730
I'm Chief of Wushuang City's Lunwu Hall,

09:11.670 --> 09:12.850
Jian Wudi.

09:13.200 --> 09:13.770
Pleasure to meet you.

09:15.870 --> 09:16.940
Wushuang City?

09:18.550 --> 09:19.730
Is it that impressive?

09:21.240 --> 09:22.460
Still, your name

09:22.750 --> 09:23.850
is quite something.

09:24.670 --> 09:25.850
Jian Wudi...

09:28.630 --> 09:29.820
Before me,

09:30.030 --> 09:31.220
you dare claim you're unrivaled (wudi)?

09:33.390 --> 09:33.850
Sir,

09:34.630 --> 09:35.770
who on earth is he?

09:37.150 --> 09:38.610
Among the Five Sword Deities,

09:39.390 --> 09:40.940
he alone bears the word "fury".

09:41.670 --> 09:43.250
He's the Furious Sword Deity, Yan Zhantian.

09:44.360 --> 09:46.180
He wields the famed blade Breaker of Armies.

09:47.390 --> 09:48.610
Of the five,

09:49.440 --> 09:52.130
his slaughter aura is the heaviest.

09:55.480 --> 09:56.890
A worthy opponent.

09:58.510 --> 09:59.580
But it seems

10:00.080 --> 10:01.770
he's trapped by the floral poison.

10:02.600 --> 10:04.010
He's using his sword energy

10:04.320 --> 10:05.300
to barely carve out

10:05.840 --> 10:07.220
a pocket of space.

10:08.080 --> 10:11.300
But he still can't leave this inn!

10:13.600 --> 10:14.700
You think

10:15.150 --> 10:16.420
such petty tricks can hold me?

10:17.390 --> 10:18.460
In four hours,

10:18.510 --> 10:20.250
this floral poison

10:20.480 --> 10:21.940
will lose all effect.

10:22.840 --> 10:24.650
Then I'll stride out, blade in hand,

10:25.200 --> 10:26.940
and none of you will live!

10:32.030 --> 10:32.490
Oh, right,

10:33.720 --> 10:35.030
do you carry

10:35.030 --> 10:36.490
the antidote to Blossom Ash?

10:37.300 --> 10:37.820
I...

10:38.550 --> 10:39.580
No!

10:41.240 --> 10:41.580
Sir,

10:42.080 --> 10:43.460
don't lose sight of the big picture.

10:44.000 --> 10:45.060
If you let him out,

10:45.360 --> 10:46.940
our plan could go up in smoke.

10:47.790 --> 10:49.180
Let's find Zhuo Yue'an first.

10:56.150 --> 10:56.850
Jian Wudi

10:56.910 --> 10:58.100
really isn't right in the head.

10:59.000 --> 11:00.300
Just to face a Sword Deity,

11:00.840 --> 11:02.060
he'd hand Yan Zhantian the antidote.

11:02.120 --> 11:03.730
What a crazy idea.

11:24.910 --> 11:25.490
Forget it.

11:32.390 --> 11:33.370
If you're not fighting,

11:33.840 --> 11:35.100
then get lost!

12:07.030 --> 12:08.010
No need to regret it.

12:09.480 --> 12:10.820
I'll cross blades with him one day.

12:12.910 --> 12:13.700
Why is that archfiend

12:14.120 --> 12:15.490
in Sihuai City?

12:16.960 --> 12:18.530
You think only one came?

12:20.030 --> 12:21.250
You mean...

12:22.440 --> 12:23.850
there's more than one master?

12:24.240 --> 12:24.610
No.

12:26.150 --> 12:26.850
I mean

12:27.960 --> 12:29.220
more than one Sword Deity came.

12:30.030 --> 12:30.420
Sword...

12:33.270 --> 12:34.460
Set the Sword Deities aside for now.

12:35.150 --> 12:36.010
Zhuo Yue'an

12:36.030 --> 12:36.820
is in the courtyard up ahead.

12:37.630 --> 12:38.940
You experts can fight it out.

12:39.440 --> 12:40.850
No need for me to watch.

12:41.320 --> 12:41.700
After you.

12:48.080 --> 12:48.420
Come here!

12:54.030 --> 12:55.340
Who is it this time?

13:06.840 --> 13:07.940
Only two people alive

13:08.000 --> 13:09.490
could wield a sword energy this freezing.

13:09.670 --> 13:10.770
The Blizzard Blade won't come here,

13:10.870 --> 13:11.580
so you must be...

13:15.390 --> 13:17.300
Don't tell me my luck is that bad.

13:18.080 --> 13:19.250
Why aren't you poisoned?

13:26.000 --> 13:26.890
I don't know.

13:28.630 --> 13:30.180
Because you and the poisoner

13:30.480 --> 13:31.490
are in it together.

13:33.270 --> 13:34.220
Hand over the antidote, now!

13:35.200 --> 13:35.650
I...

13:36.030 --> 13:37.420
I don't have it.

13:39.150 --> 13:40.350
Then die now!

13:40.350 --> 13:41.060
Wait!

13:46.790 --> 13:47.460
I do...

13:49.320 --> 13:49.730
I do!

13:57.910 --> 13:58.530
My girl,

13:59.360 --> 14:00.220
give me a pill.

14:00.720 --> 14:02.300
I'll go see what's happening outside.

14:03.320 --> 14:04.610
The Poison Enchantress told me

14:04.910 --> 14:05.820
only a few can resist

14:06.390 --> 14:07.980
this floral poison array.

14:08.320 --> 14:09.220
Young lady,

14:09.270 --> 14:10.420
though you look young,

14:10.720 --> 14:11.650
you have quite the backing.

14:12.240 --> 14:12.980
Who are you?

14:13.240 --> 14:14.530
Dian Ye, the Flying Tiger General.

14:15.200 --> 14:16.330
[Dian Ye, the Flying Tiger General]
Not counting the Prince of Langya,

14:16.330 --> 14:17.770
his standing in the Beili Army

14:18.150 --> 14:20.250
is second only to Commander-in-Chief Ye Xiaoying.

14:20.600 --> 14:21.610
A general...

14:21.910 --> 14:22.770
what's he doing here?

14:23.150 --> 14:23.730
Good question.

14:24.320 --> 14:24.890
Why indeed?

14:25.390 --> 14:26.420
Su Changhe,

14:26.670 --> 14:27.340
Su Muyu,

14:27.870 --> 14:29.220
Blood River's current leaders,

14:29.510 --> 14:30.250
I'm here

14:31.000 --> 14:31.890
for you, of course.

14:32.270 --> 14:33.650
As a court general,

14:33.910 --> 14:35.530
you're interested in Blood River?

14:36.630 --> 14:37.580
What are you after?

14:38.870 --> 14:39.770
You want this?

14:41.510 --> 14:42.300
And this too?

14:43.670 --> 14:44.850
Patriarch of Blood River,

14:45.600 --> 14:46.300
you're clever.

14:47.240 --> 14:48.460
How did the dragon-head hilt

14:48.670 --> 14:49.700
of the Dormant Dragon Sword end up on your dagger?

14:50.270 --> 14:51.650
I had Xie Qianji refit it.

14:52.030 --> 14:53.060
I don't use a longsword,

14:53.270 --> 14:54.610
and lugging the Dormant Dragon Sword around

14:54.670 --> 14:55.340
is a pain.

14:57.550 --> 14:58.220
Dian Ye

14:58.720 --> 15:00.340
is First Prince Xiao Yong's uncle.

15:00.960 --> 15:02.100
And Xiao Yong is a leading contender

15:02.150 --> 15:03.250
for the throne.

15:03.440 --> 15:04.580
Looks like they've planned this day

15:04.670 --> 15:05.530
for a long time.

15:06.390 --> 15:07.770
They want to take Wushuang City

15:08.030 --> 15:09.460
and seize Blood River's treasures.

15:10.440 --> 15:11.250
Su Muyu,

15:11.960 --> 15:13.580
this revenge duel of yours

15:14.080 --> 15:15.940
has been thoroughly used.

15:16.390 --> 15:17.490
A sword is a noble weapon.

15:18.320 --> 15:19.250
Those who exploit it

15:20.080 --> 15:21.730
will die by it.

15:24.550 --> 15:26.060
You know who we are,

15:27.320 --> 15:28.180
yet you came alone?

15:30.360 --> 15:31.850
You've got a death wish, huh?

15:37.790 --> 15:39.180
He's a general, after all.

15:39.630 --> 15:40.580
If you fight him openly,

15:40.670 --> 15:41.250
head-on,

15:41.670 --> 15:43.420
you'll only bring Blood River trouble.

15:43.720 --> 15:44.370
Let me do it instead.

15:44.960 --> 15:45.420
Anyway,

15:45.670 --> 15:47.300
I'm just a free blade from Nan'an.

15:47.790 --> 15:49.100
For you two youngsters,

15:49.600 --> 15:50.420
I'll test

15:50.600 --> 15:51.980
the general's golden axe.

15:58.670 --> 15:59.610
That city

16:00.150 --> 16:01.010
has begun to stir.

16:01.840 --> 16:02.460
Tonight?

16:03.360 --> 16:04.980
The news shouldn't spread so fast.

16:05.200 --> 16:07.340
But by the signs before,

16:07.550 --> 16:10.130
tonight is when they strike.

16:10.670 --> 16:11.220
However,

16:11.510 --> 16:12.460
what they didn't expect

16:12.720 --> 16:14.130
is that Sihuai City today

16:14.240 --> 16:15.770
is no ordinary Sihuai City.

16:16.030 --> 16:17.250
They lured Blood River over,

16:17.390 --> 16:18.180
while I invited

16:18.550 --> 16:20.420
three Sword Deities

16:20.480 --> 16:21.610
to watch the show.

16:24.320 --> 16:24.940
Xiao Yong

16:25.440 --> 16:26.770
meant to use this chance

16:27.360 --> 16:28.490
to control Wushuang City

16:28.840 --> 16:30.010
and grow his power.

16:30.720 --> 16:31.820
But he never imagined

16:32.120 --> 16:32.940
Su Muyu

16:33.200 --> 16:34.100
would deliberately tip us off

16:34.150 --> 16:35.250
that someone meant

16:35.630 --> 16:36.370
to use him.

16:38.390 --> 16:40.180
Su Muyu is a clever one.

16:40.910 --> 16:42.250
In this Wushuang turmoil,

16:42.480 --> 16:44.100
the final break

16:44.440 --> 16:45.980
still rests on his choice:

16:46.390 --> 16:48.370
whether to remain Su Muyu

16:48.600 --> 16:50.890
or become Zhuo Yue'an.

17:10.030 --> 17:11.330
Now that is a master.

17:12.270 --> 17:13.250
Who goes there?

17:14.720 --> 17:15.940
Jian Wudi.

17:16.640 --> 17:17.980
What an arrogant name.

17:18.310 --> 17:20.010
Today is my first bout since leaving seclusion.

17:20.680 --> 17:21.490
Anyone not fighting,

17:21.720 --> 17:22.860
clear out.

17:24.680 --> 17:25.570
General Dian Ye,

17:26.070 --> 17:27.090
you can just watch.

17:28.960 --> 17:29.570
Seems

17:30.070 --> 17:30.860
you have some right

17:30.920 --> 17:32.180
to be arrogant.

17:32.480 --> 17:33.530
Xiao Yong promised me

17:34.000 --> 17:35.250
a fine "sword"

17:35.790 --> 17:36.810
to test my skills.

17:37.110 --> 17:37.770
Looks like

17:39.000 --> 17:40.810
you're the "sword" I came for!

18:16.550 --> 18:17.770
I've always accompanied Su Muyu

18:17.830 --> 18:18.810
to these duels,

18:19.400 --> 18:20.860
finding them silly.

18:21.550 --> 18:22.420
He liked them,

18:22.680 --> 18:23.490
so I played along.

18:24.310 --> 18:25.660
But now...

18:25.960 --> 18:26.770
Suddenly it feels

18:27.400 --> 18:28.290
like it means something?

18:28.480 --> 18:29.090
No.

18:30.310 --> 18:31.770
It suddenly feels even sillier.

18:33.720 --> 18:34.770
Because Su Muyu seems

18:35.510 --> 18:36.490
unable to beat that man.

18:49.590 --> 18:50.730
A fine "sword" indeed.

18:51.310 --> 18:52.050
In you,

18:53.110 --> 18:54.730
I see my father's shadow.

18:56.400 --> 18:58.380
Zhuo Yuluo, Lord of No-Sword City.

18:59.070 --> 19:00.250
With a pure sword-heart,

19:00.880 --> 19:02.460
he's an absolute devotee of the Sword's Way.

19:03.510 --> 19:04.700
Other than my father,

19:05.350 --> 19:06.460
I've never seen

19:06.550 --> 19:07.980
such pure sword intent.

19:08.510 --> 19:09.660
One who wields the sword

19:10.920 --> 19:12.380
must keep a single mind.

19:12.960 --> 19:14.290
Seems that battle at Wushuang City

19:15.070 --> 19:16.290
no longer matters.

19:17.000 --> 19:18.330
It's my honor

19:19.030 --> 19:20.090
to cross blades with you.

19:20.270 --> 19:21.420
My last stroke

19:21.830 --> 19:23.980
held intent, no technique.

19:25.000 --> 19:26.490
You blocked it beautifully.

19:27.000 --> 19:28.810
But every stroke that follows

19:29.510 --> 19:31.090
won't be like the last,

19:32.400 --> 19:33.180
only growing stronger

19:34.240 --> 19:34.940
and harsher.

19:35.510 --> 19:36.730
All the better.

19:44.830 --> 19:46.420
True masters of the Sword's Way

19:47.030 --> 19:48.330
each bear their own sword intent.

19:49.270 --> 19:50.180
His intent

19:50.790 --> 19:51.730
is pure,

19:53.110 --> 19:54.290
without a speck of impurity.

19:54.790 --> 19:55.810
A decade honing one blade,

19:56.750 --> 19:58.420
that is true purity.

20:01.160 --> 20:02.180
Do you feel it?

20:03.440 --> 20:04.490
As if rain is coming.

20:08.270 --> 20:10.860
There's a chill.

20:17.070 --> 20:17.860
His sword energy

20:18.030 --> 20:19.380
carries a trace of rain.

20:51.920 --> 20:52.860
Fine "sword"!

21:15.680 --> 21:17.330
Looks like a brilliant duel.

21:20.640 --> 21:21.250
It is.

21:22.240 --> 21:23.140
Truly brilliant.

21:24.440 --> 21:25.010
You're here.

21:27.480 --> 21:29.050
So from now on,

21:29.680 --> 21:30.900
the jianghu will have six Sword Deities?

21:32.100 --> 21:34.060
♪Watch the flames across the river...♪

21:34.880 --> 21:35.770
Seems Su Muyu

21:36.030 --> 21:37.700
has met a worthy foe.

21:38.070 --> 21:39.250
He even spent

21:39.270 --> 21:40.060
his trump card.

21:40.110 --> 21:41.290
You called my sword intent

21:42.240 --> 21:43.490
the purest

21:44.200 --> 21:45.420
you've ever seen.

21:46.270 --> 21:47.250
But yours

21:48.000 --> 21:49.050
is the most complex

21:50.070 --> 21:51.220
I've seen.

21:51.880 --> 21:52.940
Your sword intent carries

21:53.000 --> 21:54.810
too many feelings:

21:55.720 --> 21:56.570
anger,

21:57.110 --> 21:57.770
defiance,

21:58.240 --> 21:58.810
forbearance,

21:58.830 --> 21:59.530
compromise,

22:00.070 --> 22:01.380
even gentleness...

22:01.920 --> 22:03.620
almost the full range

22:03.640 --> 22:04.940
of a human heart.

22:05.960 --> 22:07.700
What have you lived through

22:09.070 --> 22:10.050
to swing

22:10.830 --> 22:12.940
so complex a blade?

22:12.940 --> 22:15.980
♪This battle is mine alone, against myself♪

22:16.140 --> 22:20.580
♪The path lies beneath my feet. I see muddy prints...♪

22:22.350 --> 22:22.940
And then

22:23.960 --> 22:25.140
all falls quiet.

22:26.270 --> 22:26.900
You lost?

22:28.720 --> 22:29.380
I won.

22:34.920 --> 22:35.620
Not good.

22:35.960 --> 22:37.050
Very not good.

22:38.350 --> 22:39.010
If you won,

22:39.440 --> 22:40.490
why is it not good?

22:41.200 --> 22:41.940
Because Su Muyu

22:42.000 --> 22:42.770
used his strongest strike

22:42.830 --> 22:43.730
yet didn't kill him.

22:44.680 --> 22:45.290
And the opponent

22:46.240 --> 22:47.090
hasn't gone all out.

22:48.160 --> 22:49.730
That last strike was excellent.

22:50.790 --> 22:52.180
May I have its name?

22:52.920 --> 22:53.570
Rain Surge.

22:54.510 --> 22:55.420
Rain Surge...

22:58.680 --> 23:00.770
I call myself Jian Wudi,

23:01.350 --> 23:03.220
yet in my first fight out of seclusion

23:03.830 --> 23:05.660
against my first opponent,

23:06.400 --> 23:07.620
I lost.

23:08.310 --> 23:08.940
But from

23:09.000 --> 23:10.660
that strike just now,

23:10.920 --> 23:12.660
I've gained new insight.

23:13.550 --> 23:14.940
With the next stroke,

23:17.510 --> 23:18.420
you will lose...

23:20.590 --> 23:21.290
and die.

23:23.110 --> 23:23.860
My turn.

23:26.310 --> 23:27.250
Let me try again.

23:29.680 --> 23:31.660
None of you are getting away.

23:42.720 --> 23:43.620
Indeed...

23:46.110 --> 23:47.010
Pure sword intent

23:47.440 --> 23:48.660
is rare in this world.

23:49.030 --> 23:50.050
But when anything

23:50.110 --> 23:50.770
pushes past

23:50.790 --> 23:52.220
the point of return,

23:52.790 --> 23:53.570
the utmost good

23:53.590 --> 23:54.980
turns to utmost evil,

23:55.400 --> 23:56.250
the utmost evil

23:56.720 --> 23:58.220
becomes utmost good;

23:58.680 --> 23:59.940
and the brightest light

24:00.110 --> 24:01.490
is nothing but darkness.

24:02.110 --> 24:02.770
He's about

24:03.720 --> 24:05.570
to go fully demonic.

24:08.110 --> 24:09.940
If going demonic makes my sword stronger,

24:10.640 --> 24:11.810
why not?

24:12.880 --> 24:13.980
If you don't turn back

24:14.110 --> 24:15.330
and keep wielding the sword like this,

24:15.880 --> 24:16.900
within a year,

24:17.240 --> 24:18.490
your sword intent will turn on you.

24:18.640 --> 24:20.180
Your inner channels will snap and you'll die!

24:22.350 --> 24:23.900
My father was devoted to the sword too,

24:25.110 --> 24:26.220
but he never ignored

24:26.270 --> 24:27.530
his family or his people.

24:27.790 --> 24:28.660
You can treat the sword

24:28.680 --> 24:29.900
as the most important thing,

24:30.160 --> 24:30.810
but it

24:31.960 --> 24:33.330
must not be the only thing.

24:34.720 --> 24:36.140
People may betray you,

24:39.070 --> 24:39.810
but a sword...

24:41.550 --> 24:42.290
won't!

24:45.110 --> 24:46.290
After all this time,

24:46.550 --> 24:47.810
you still follow

24:48.270 --> 24:49.620
such an extreme Way of the Sword.

24:50.200 --> 24:50.860
It's you.

24:52.350 --> 24:53.330
Our duel

24:53.750 --> 24:54.770
will have to wait.

24:55.550 --> 24:56.290
If so,

24:56.680 --> 24:57.730
let's join hands against him.

24:58.350 --> 25:00.220
A fortunate turn, perhaps.

25:01.790 --> 25:02.620
Senior Wudi!

25:05.270 --> 25:06.140
Long time no see!

25:07.240 --> 25:08.290
All these years,

25:09.400 --> 25:10.620
why are you still

25:10.680 --> 25:11.620
at the same realm?

25:12.030 --> 25:12.900
The longer you hold the bottleneck,

25:13.400 --> 25:14.290
the stronger the breakthrough.

25:15.200 --> 25:15.980
I've been waiting for the moment,

25:16.440 --> 25:17.380
one strike to divinity.

25:18.200 --> 25:19.090
One strike...

25:21.070 --> 25:21.980
to divinity?

25:23.590 --> 25:24.460
A pity.

25:25.110 --> 25:26.330
You won't get that chance!

25:29.640 --> 25:30.660
Senior Wudi,

25:31.270 --> 25:32.700
seems you've joined the chaos too.

25:33.480 --> 25:34.530
Since you've betrayed Wushuang City,

25:35.000 --> 25:35.730
don't blame me

25:36.200 --> 25:36.980
for putting duty over kin!

25:37.200 --> 25:37.900
Before he went demonic,

25:38.070 --> 25:39.220
he was close to a Sword Deity.

25:39.720 --> 25:40.810
Now, fully demonic,

25:41.480 --> 25:42.530
his power is immeasurable.

25:42.830 --> 25:44.330
As City Lord of Wushuang,

25:44.790 --> 25:46.380
I can't best anyone after all?

25:47.000 --> 25:48.140
At the peak comes decline.

25:48.750 --> 25:50.620
A demonic body looks mighty,

25:51.070 --> 25:52.380
but it's hollow.

25:53.350 --> 25:54.090
Find the weak point

25:54.270 --> 25:55.380
and one strike will kill!

25:59.590 --> 26:01.010
Someone steeped in obsession

26:01.480 --> 26:02.700
is going demonic here.

26:07.400 --> 26:08.290
It's from the Scholarly Sword Deity.

26:09.790 --> 26:10.530
One Stroke Cuts Water!

27:07.310 --> 27:08.090
Swallow Turns Back!

27:13.000 --> 27:13.700
I have a strike too!

27:18.070 --> 27:18.530
It's called...

27:20.440 --> 27:21.250
Mountain Rain at Dusk!

27:24.830 --> 27:26.050
After fresh rain on empty hills,

27:26.920 --> 27:28.380
autumn comes with the evening chill.

28:02.880 --> 28:03.770
You live for the sword,

28:04.480 --> 28:05.380
but a sword is a dead thing.

28:06.440 --> 28:07.530
Living for dead things

28:08.240 --> 28:09.940
will get you hit a dead end.

28:11.000 --> 28:12.490
But the only thing that stays with me

28:15.110 --> 28:16.220
is my sword.

28:17.720 --> 28:18.900
Everything else

28:19.750 --> 28:22.220
leaves me.

28:23.310 --> 28:24.220
Senior Wudi.

28:26.920 --> 28:27.980
I didn't win...

28:31.880 --> 28:32.570
but you

28:33.590 --> 28:34.940
didn't really either.

28:49.880 --> 28:50.700
General Dian,

28:51.640 --> 28:52.860
we'll spare you this once.

28:53.720 --> 28:55.180
From now on, be careful.

28:56.200 --> 28:57.180
And stop scheming

28:58.070 --> 28:59.380
against Blood River.

29:08.880 --> 29:10.490
We didn't duel today,

29:11.270 --> 29:12.220
but after this fight,

29:13.200 --> 29:14.050
I have no regrets.

29:15.550 --> 29:16.290
Never thought

29:17.000 --> 29:18.010
Blood River

29:19.000 --> 29:20.330
would have a swordsman like you.

29:21.400 --> 29:22.140
What?

29:23.000 --> 29:23.980
Should everyone in Blood River

29:24.350 --> 29:25.660
be like me?

29:27.350 --> 29:28.420
You two, don't just stand there.

29:28.680 --> 29:30.800
You burned through a lot of sword moves today.

29:30.830 --> 29:31.900
Sit right now

29:31.960 --> 29:32.700
and reset your breath.

29:33.270 --> 29:33.770
Remember:

29:33.960 --> 29:35.010
after a fight,

29:35.310 --> 29:36.570
you must promptly regulate

29:36.640 --> 29:37.460
your breathing.

29:54.440 --> 29:55.270
Awesome!

29:55.360 --> 29:56.490
Yeah, really awesome!

29:59.400 --> 30:00.380
Senior, your strike

30:00.550 --> 30:01.900
was crisp and commanding.

30:02.640 --> 30:03.660
No wonder Master says

30:03.960 --> 30:05.030
you're the most gifted

30:05.070 --> 30:05.810
among our generation.

30:06.030 --> 30:06.380
Right.

30:06.680 --> 30:08.290
If the City Lord watches training,

30:08.590 --> 30:10.010
he might take a shine to you

30:10.110 --> 30:11.330
and accept you as a personal disciple!

30:15.640 --> 30:16.180
That's not enough.

30:17.110 --> 30:17.810
My force isn't enough.

30:19.200 --> 30:19.900
I still need work.

30:22.590 --> 30:23.900
You're ever striving for perfection.

30:24.510 --> 30:25.090
In time,

30:25.160 --> 30:26.460
you'll be Wushuang City's backbone,

30:26.960 --> 30:28.290
the pillar we all rely on!

30:31.720 --> 30:32.530
The City Lord is here!

30:38.000 --> 30:40.250
Greetings, Sir!

30:41.030 --> 30:41.530
Enough.

30:43.640 --> 30:44.290
Yanhui,

30:44.960 --> 30:45.490
this place

30:46.000 --> 30:47.140
is the practice ground

30:47.200 --> 30:47.810
of Wushuang City.

30:48.960 --> 30:50.180
By day, I handle affairs.

30:50.750 --> 30:51.530
In the meantime,

30:51.790 --> 30:52.570
you can come here

30:52.750 --> 30:54.290
and spar with the brothers.

30:55.030 --> 30:55.810
At dusk,

30:56.160 --> 30:57.180
return to the City Lord's manor

30:57.680 --> 30:58.570
to work your forms.

31:01.920 --> 31:02.770
His name is Yanhui.

31:03.070 --> 31:03.810
You lot,

31:04.030 --> 31:05.140
look after him.

31:05.550 --> 31:06.570
- Got it! - Got it!

31:18.590 --> 31:19.250
Senior Jian,

31:19.720 --> 31:20.490
you okay?

31:24.880 --> 31:25.420
Again!

31:27.480 --> 31:28.090
Come on!

31:33.830 --> 31:34.530
Senior Jian,

31:35.750 --> 31:37.420
I need to get back and train at the manor.

31:39.070 --> 31:40.010
See you tomorrow.

31:49.640 --> 31:50.490
I will beat you.

31:51.440 --> 31:52.380
I will beat you!

31:53.160 --> 31:54.620
Even if you have the strongest master

31:55.400 --> 31:56.420
and practice the finest sword art,

31:56.920 --> 31:57.810
I will beat you!

32:01.510 --> 32:02.510
I, Jian Wudi,

32:02.880 --> 32:03.980
don't yield!

32:04.350 --> 32:05.290
I, Jian Wudi,

32:05.680 --> 32:06.900
am meant to be unrivaled!

32:09.110 --> 32:09.940
Senior Wudi,

32:12.550 --> 32:13.380
at first light tomorrow,

32:14.310 --> 32:15.940
I'll have people see you buried.

32:17.000 --> 32:18.810
As for our brotherhood...

32:21.160 --> 32:22.010
let's carry it to the next life.

32:39.440 --> 32:41.380
How did you avoid this floral poison?

32:42.510 --> 32:43.900
A Sword Deity

32:44.200 --> 32:45.900
trapped by a petty floral poison,

32:46.440 --> 32:47.700
isn't that ridiculous?

32:51.200 --> 32:52.050
Truly ridiculous.

32:52.750 --> 32:53.530
So,

32:53.640 --> 32:54.490
how did you break free?

32:55.000 --> 32:55.940
Teach your brother here.

32:56.880 --> 32:57.810
Naturally...

32:58.880 --> 32:59.460
with an antidote.

33:01.680 --> 33:03.250
Third City Lord gave it to you?

33:03.550 --> 33:04.460
No way.

33:11.240 --> 33:11.980
Xueyue Sword Deity,

33:12.960 --> 33:14.730
you're Xueyue City's Second City Lord.

33:15.550 --> 33:16.290
Yet you act

33:16.440 --> 33:17.770
so rough

33:17.960 --> 33:18.620
and rude,

33:18.920 --> 33:19.860
truly...

33:21.830 --> 33:23.220
a "heroine among women"!

33:27.000 --> 33:28.140
Hand over all your antidote.

33:29.160 --> 33:30.090
My antidote for this floral poison

33:30.110 --> 33:30.980
is worth a fortune.

33:31.270 --> 33:32.770
It's not something for charity.

33:33.160 --> 33:34.140
Who are you trying to save now?

33:34.590 --> 33:35.330
Me.

33:39.400 --> 33:40.730
Wait, who are you?

33:42.720 --> 33:43.330
I'm Xie Xuan.

33:44.270 --> 33:45.010
Xie Xuan...

33:47.640 --> 33:48.490
Any antidote left?

33:48.590 --> 33:49.290
Yes... yes!

33:50.310 --> 33:51.050
Right here.

33:54.640 --> 33:55.490
Much obliged, good sir.

34:04.000 --> 34:04.700
By the way, City Lord Li,

34:05.590 --> 34:06.380
In the city,

34:06.440 --> 34:07.570
there are still many jianghu folks

34:07.720 --> 34:08.570
poisoned by this floral poison.

34:09.000 --> 34:10.050
As Sword Deities,

34:10.280 --> 34:11.740
we should lend a hand.

34:12.760 --> 34:13.940
There's plenty of antidote in this vial.

34:14.760 --> 34:15.460
This floral poison

34:15.670 --> 34:16.940
seems weaker than before.

34:17.230 --> 34:17.860
How do we save them?

34:19.840 --> 34:20.980
Grind the antidote to powder

34:21.630 --> 34:22.570
and spread it across the city.

34:23.550 --> 34:24.490
Since the toxin came from flowers,

34:24.880 --> 34:26.010
let flowers end it.

34:26.590 --> 34:27.340
In this world,

34:27.880 --> 34:29.780
only you can bring a city of blossoms

34:30.800 --> 34:31.420
with a single sword.

34:32.110 --> 34:32.610
All right.

35:03.550 --> 35:04.460
This...

35:04.800 --> 35:06.130
this is the fabled...

35:18.280 --> 35:19.340
The Floral Sword Art!

35:39.700 --> 35:43.780
[Luoyang Tavern]

35:47.070 --> 35:48.650
No more waiting!

36:16.190 --> 36:18.610
I actually cleared the poison thanks to that woman.

36:20.510 --> 36:22.130
How vexing.

36:27.280 --> 36:28.300
Your swordwork

36:29.150 --> 36:29.980
is still as beautiful.

36:31.190 --> 36:32.650
On my way here,

36:33.280 --> 36:34.780
I ran into some folks from Baixiao Hall.

36:35.360 --> 36:36.780
They asked me a favor.

36:37.840 --> 36:39.420
I hate that kind of thing.

36:39.920 --> 36:40.650
However,

36:41.150 --> 36:42.300
my mother and he both serve

36:42.800 --> 36:44.260
among the Four Guardians.

36:45.070 --> 36:46.460
Since Mother asked me to help him,

36:47.280 --> 36:48.530
of course I will.

36:49.400 --> 36:49.940
Good thing

36:50.480 --> 36:51.130
I ran into you.

36:52.670 --> 36:53.610
I see.

36:54.510 --> 36:56.260
So Ji Ruofeng gathered us here

36:56.920 --> 36:58.460
not for a show,

36:59.590 --> 37:01.130
but with his own designs.

37:02.590 --> 37:03.780
But Baixiao Hall came to you.

37:04.550 --> 37:05.530
What's that to me?

37:06.510 --> 37:08.260
I cleared your poison just now.

37:08.760 --> 37:09.980
- I... - I did you a favor.

37:10.230 --> 37:11.260
You owe me.

37:12.030 --> 37:12.610
I suppose

37:13.150 --> 37:14.420
your sages' books

37:14.550 --> 37:15.460
teach that too, no?

37:18.670 --> 37:19.690
You speak true.

37:20.190 --> 37:20.980
What do you need from me?

37:24.000 --> 37:25.170
Take us to your master.

37:26.550 --> 37:27.650
Sword Deity, you jest.

37:28.480 --> 37:29.690
If I take you, I'm dead.

37:30.000 --> 37:31.570
Just leave a little early

37:31.840 --> 37:32.780
before we arrive.

37:34.110 --> 37:35.820
If you don't take us,

37:36.400 --> 37:37.910
- you die right now. - I...

37:38.800 --> 37:39.490
Hey!

37:40.710 --> 37:42.010
I can't help anyway.

37:44.030 --> 37:44.650
Lead on.

37:46.280 --> 37:46.900
This way, please.

37:49.960 --> 37:50.490
Driver,

37:50.960 --> 37:52.010
we'll borrow your carriage.

37:52.360 --> 37:52.980
It's dangerous in the city.

37:53.190 --> 37:54.300
Wait here.

37:54.670 --> 37:55.460
At daybreak,

37:55.670 --> 37:56.490
we'll be back.

37:58.360 --> 37:58.820
All right.

38:19.900 --> 38:21.090
What was that all about?

38:27.550 --> 38:28.860
We came all this way,

38:29.400 --> 38:30.860
saw no good fight,

38:31.480 --> 38:32.260
and now we're cleaning up

38:32.320 --> 38:33.130
Baixiao Hall's mess.

38:33.710 --> 38:34.610
Pretty frustrating, huh?

38:35.480 --> 38:36.050
Fair enough.

38:36.880 --> 38:38.340
Once we're done,

38:38.590 --> 38:40.010
let me cross blades

38:40.320 --> 38:41.210
with the Scholarly Sword Deity.

38:42.070 --> 38:42.900
Then it's worth the trip.

38:48.670 --> 38:49.570
They say Song Yanhui

38:49.590 --> 38:50.210
crossed swords with you

38:50.510 --> 38:51.260
and lost badly.

38:52.030 --> 38:53.610
How come you're still keen on his swordwork?

38:55.920 --> 38:57.900
Song's swordwork is indeed good,

38:58.670 --> 38:59.340
but

38:59.880 --> 39:01.090
Wushuang City holds him back.

39:02.150 --> 39:02.650
Also,

39:04.360 --> 39:05.340
I want to see

39:06.190 --> 39:07.170
Su Muyu's swordwork.

39:08.030 --> 39:09.210
Weren't you together

39:09.280 --> 39:10.780
in the siege on Ye Dingzhi?

39:11.360 --> 39:12.380
Didn't you see his swordwork?

39:13.880 --> 39:14.740
He once said

39:15.630 --> 39:16.300
his "sword"

39:17.000 --> 39:17.650
is no sword...

39:18.360 --> 39:19.090
it's a killing tool.

39:19.960 --> 39:21.940
Only when he returns under a new name

39:22.400 --> 39:23.610
will you see his true swordwork.

39:24.760 --> 39:25.490
He's powerful.

39:26.710 --> 39:27.860
If not for him back then,

39:28.760 --> 39:30.050
we'd never have wounded

39:30.110 --> 39:31.090
Ye Dingzhi so badly.

39:36.190 --> 39:37.010
This Blossom Ash

39:37.110 --> 39:38.340
isn't as thick as before.

39:38.440 --> 39:39.530
I'll pack up

39:39.590 --> 39:40.860
and we can leave this courtyard.

39:48.360 --> 39:48.980
Mr. Zhuo.

39:55.360 --> 39:56.340
After this fight,

39:56.800 --> 39:57.860
our test duel

39:58.320 --> 39:59.420
will likely be delayed.

39:59.920 --> 40:01.010
Someone wants to use our bout

40:01.070 --> 40:01.940
for trouble.

40:02.630 --> 40:03.980
If it stirs up chaos

40:04.590 --> 40:05.860
and innocents die again,

40:06.960 --> 40:08.860
the trial loses its point.

40:09.440 --> 40:10.260
Besides,

40:10.960 --> 40:12.260
fighting side by side,

40:13.150 --> 40:14.860
I've felt your sword intent.

40:15.880 --> 40:16.490
It's good.

40:18.590 --> 40:20.300
Had my father met you then,

40:21.480 --> 40:22.380
perhaps

40:23.150 --> 40:24.340
it wouldn't have ended that way.

40:26.510 --> 40:28.300
Wushuang City owes No-Sword City,

40:29.030 --> 40:30.210
and owes you.

40:31.440 --> 40:32.740
I trained in Blood River,

40:33.670 --> 40:34.650
but I'm here

40:35.440 --> 40:36.780
to carry my father's Way.

40:38.030 --> 40:38.940
I only meant

40:38.960 --> 40:39.900
to avenge him

40:40.440 --> 40:41.860
and restore No-Sword City's name,

40:42.840 --> 40:44.380
not to wreck Wushuang.

40:46.150 --> 40:47.260
Push it

40:48.800 --> 40:50.380
and I'd be another Liu Yunqi.

40:51.800 --> 40:53.260
My master was mortally hurt

40:54.150 --> 40:55.170
and has passed.

40:59.400 --> 41:00.300
He was my enemy

41:01.590 --> 41:02.530
and your master.

41:04.110 --> 41:05.170
Now vengeance is done,

41:06.070 --> 41:07.130
I'm pleased.

41:09.110 --> 41:10.490
But such joy should not be shown

41:10.550 --> 41:11.300
before you.

41:12.190 --> 41:12.860
I understand.

41:13.590 --> 41:14.260
Mr. Zhuo,

41:14.800 --> 41:16.380
until we meet again.

41:16.920 --> 41:17.650
If there's a chance,

41:18.480 --> 41:19.740
I'd like to see your sword

41:20.150 --> 41:21.380
shine even more dazzling.

41:22.760 --> 41:23.690
I fear that won't be me.

41:24.670 --> 41:25.740
But Wushuang City

41:26.230 --> 41:27.570
will have a finer "sword"

41:28.110 --> 41:29.570
to meet you.

41:31.510 --> 41:32.050
Farewell.

41:38.710 --> 41:39.490
Let's go too.

41:51.230 --> 41:52.090
He took a mortal strike

41:52.150 --> 41:52.780
from you two.

41:53.630 --> 41:54.570
He can't be alive!

41:55.230 --> 41:55.980
No pain,

41:56.480 --> 41:57.130
no fear,

41:57.880 --> 41:58.530
only the will to kill.

41:59.150 --> 42:00.090
That's not something "going demonic"

42:00.150 --> 42:00.860
can explain.

42:01.360 --> 42:02.130
Could it be...

42:10.440 --> 42:10.980
What?

42:11.400 --> 42:12.940
It's Xichu's drugged puppet art!

42:13.320 --> 42:13.980
It makes the dead

42:14.000 --> 42:15.010
rise and fight.

42:15.320 --> 42:16.820
Back when Xichu

42:16.840 --> 42:17.570
fought Beili,

42:17.630 --> 42:19.050
they used it

42:19.230 --> 42:20.420
to drag the war on.

42:20.590 --> 42:21.610
It defies heaven's order.

42:21.800 --> 42:22.900
But its power was so strange

42:23.110 --> 42:23.980
the Scholarly Deity of Xichu

42:24.030 --> 42:25.780
couldn't bear to destroy it,

42:26.000 --> 42:27.690
and passed it to Medicine King Valley,

42:28.110 --> 42:28.900
hoping the Valley

42:29.000 --> 42:29.980
could find a way

42:30.150 --> 42:30.900
to turn this evil art

42:31.030 --> 42:32.260
to the right.

42:36.480 --> 42:37.090
So your Valley

42:37.150 --> 42:38.210
ended up with it.

42:38.760 --> 42:39.570
Did you fix it?

42:40.190 --> 42:40.860
No.

42:41.070 --> 42:41.980
It's so perverse

42:42.150 --> 42:43.090
that even Xin Baicao

42:43.150 --> 42:44.170
couldn't grasp it.

42:44.880 --> 42:45.820
I have a martial niece,

42:46.000 --> 42:47.420
Xin Baicao's junior sister,

42:47.630 --> 42:48.380
named Night Crow.

42:48.590 --> 42:49.610
Her husband died early,

42:49.710 --> 42:50.300
so she grew obsessed

42:50.400 --> 42:51.530
with "revival" arts,

42:51.710 --> 42:52.420
and kept studying

42:52.670 --> 42:54.380
the drugged puppet craft.

42:54.400 --> 42:54.900
Later,

42:54.920 --> 42:55.900
she betrayed the Valley

42:56.400 --> 42:57.740
and took the manual.

42:58.280 --> 42:59.130
She's now

42:59.230 --> 43:00.340
the only one who knows it.

43:00.710 --> 43:01.570
How to break it?

43:05.480 --> 43:06.340
Thirteen Glances Back!

43:07.760 --> 43:08.530
Freshly made a drugged puppet,

43:08.590 --> 43:09.460
his foul blood circulates poorly.

43:09.920 --> 43:10.610
I pinned him.

43:10.670 --> 43:11.130
Su Muyu,

43:11.320 --> 43:12.530
shred his heart with one stroke!

43:28.190 --> 43:29.300
That ends it, right?

43:30.280 --> 43:30.900
My girl!

43:38.360 --> 43:39.050
What went wrong?

43:39.320 --> 43:40.260
His poisoned blood

43:41.360 --> 43:42.860
is already in me.

43:43.150 --> 43:43.820
Troublesome.

43:44.710 --> 43:45.340
Su Muyu,

43:45.670 --> 43:46.860
there's a jade vial at my waist.

43:47.110 --> 43:48.010
Take the pill inside

43:48.230 --> 43:49.130
and give it to me.

43:52.070 --> 43:53.090
Are you fine now?

43:53.960 --> 43:54.820
The puppet poison

43:55.280 --> 43:56.340
isn't that easy to cure.

43:59.860 --> 44:03.340
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

44:03.380 --> 44:07.260
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

44:09.100 --> 44:12.580
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

44:12.620 --> 44:16.460
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

44:18.460 --> 44:21.740
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

44:21.860 --> 44:23.940
♪Still I can't let go♪

44:24.100 --> 44:27.540
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

44:28.020 --> 44:30.220
♪My heart no longer my own♪

44:30.340 --> 44:35.340
♪No one can escape from love♪

44:51.940 --> 44:55.660
♪How many hidden feelings♪

44:55.780 --> 44:59.860
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

45:01.100 --> 45:04.980
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

45:05.100 --> 45:09.340
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

45:10.460 --> 45:13.340
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

45:13.420 --> 45:17.660
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

45:19.940 --> 45:23.940
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

45:23.980 --> 45:27.420
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

